        "section_width": "container",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "html_custom": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">We are proud to welcome <br></span><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Chef and TV Host, Manu Fieldel <br>as our official LeCavist Ambassador.</strong>\n</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>As wine lovers, we believe that </span><strong>pairing</strong><span> your cherished collection </span><strong>with the right food is as important as cellaring your wine itself.</strong><br><br><strong>Chef Manu,</strong><span> known for his acclaimed restaurants, bestselling cookbooks, television appearances and lighthearted personality </span><strong>is a natural fit to our mission to enhance the enjoyment of fine wine.</strong><br><br><span>With Manu, we will share </span><strong>experts tips</strong><span> into the art of wine and food pairing, invite you to </span><strong>exclusive events</strong><span> hosted by Manu himself and </span><strong>elevate our wine &amp; dining experience together - it's all about enjoyment!</strong><br><br><strong>Bienvenue Manu,</strong><span> looking forward to </span><strong>sharing perfectly cellared wines and delicious dishes together - Sant<span data-mce-fragment=\"1\">é!</span><br></strong></p>",
